// Tamboo UI strings.
//
// Full, screen-by-screen coverage exists for English, Telugu, Hindi and Urdu — the languages
// that matter for Tamboo's Hyderabad-first launch. The other 19 languages in LANGS keep their
// original onboarding/nav translations and fall back to English for every newer key added
// since; `isFullyTranslated(lang)` reflects real coverage so the UI can flag it honestly.
//
// Adding a new string: add it to EN with a unique camelCase key (prefix with a short screen
// tag, e.g. `cartEmptyTitle`, to avoid collisions — unless it's a generic word that belongs in
// the "common" section, which every screen should reuse instead of inventing its own). Then add
// the same key to TE, HI and UR. Do not add positional array entries — this file is keyed by
// name specifically so a missing translation can never silently shift and corrupt another key.

